# todo2code ignore file.
#
# Paths listed here are excluded from `t2c watch` change detection, on top of
# whatever `.gitignore` and `.dockerignore` already exclude. Syntax is
# gitignore-compatible: `#` comments, `!` re-includes, a trailing `/` restricts
# a rule to directories, and a pattern without a slash matches at any depth.
#
# The point of this file is to keep the watcher from rebuilding a report because
# a build artefact, cache or the report itself changed.

# --- Hidden directories -----------------------------------------------------
# Every dot-directory: .git, .idea, .vscode, .venv, .cache, .github, .husky, …
.*/

# The runtime writes its own output here, so watching it would loop forever.
.intent/
.intent-*/

# Hidden files that churn without changing intent.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Build output and caches ------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/
target/
vendor/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.eggs/
*.egg-info/

# --- Lockfiles and generated manifests --------------------------------------
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
Cargo.lock
go.sum
composer.lock
poetry.lock

# --- Logs, temporary and binary artefacts -----------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.pid
*.tsbuildinfo
*.map

# Rendered diff and report artefacts regenerated on every run.
*.diff.svg
*.diff.html

# --- Local environment ------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
